      {
        "author_name": "Eldien M",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101500284636393472427/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUu-GaBp1c0zcD5LAWsvzapcI22VcubEJuGFtp61dvsOkUjEcNG8g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "One of the cleanest meat and grocery stores you can enter. It's definitely a great addition to the area and the community.\n\nAl-Tayssir boucherie recently opened, and I decided to visit it after reading few reviews and I was 100% satisfied. Meat was fresh and everything was organized to the best.\n\nThe owner is very friendly and polite. I wish them success..\n\nAll in all, it was a great experience, and I definitely recommend Al-Tayssir..",
        "time": 1676298581,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Marc-André Chevalier",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113473119748559192070/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUqTPMi45foj9HtvHlrvekQZLsV2GjoWV7SfFTh4NUS7IknCaJJiA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Moroccan Kafta Burger! The balls were meant for burger buns but I didn't have any so I used two balls instead! 🤣 Thank you so much! Amazing taste!",
        "time": 1682284909,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dr. Muhammad Naeem",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111933010543165182616/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJzPgSBFkkWLEYUpF2ERU0N2PazxawXdIYInN7SQgLo5u1_RQg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I recently went here to buy halal meat and was very impressed by the variety of products and the impeccable service. They presented a variety of marinated chicken and beef beautifully. I will be a regular customer and highly recommend them. Thank you.",
        "time": 1685486366,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "abib ouerdia",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110494253205513614424/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV5Whmoe-sWmdjAmz2ENCOb9n0r3Z4DkzZghgRh8Xtu8VTPX_gU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "High-quality meat, impeccable cleanliness, pleasantly surprised by the availability of products, all topped off with friendly and welcoming service. My partner and I were even offered cups of tea. I wish you all the best, and I will definitely be back.",
        "time": 1672776898,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Rafika J.",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112094729089255899567/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJrlUFCDQqdkuh4bAzBKX5mw2SfP8wPRgDqZq0UMxIh_O25mQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Very clean premises, fresh Halal meat. Good merguez sausages (beef and chicken). Very good minced meat too. Pleasant service and a warm welcome. Well done and keep up the good work!",
